    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此可见，向量的长度等于它的坐标的平方和的平方根。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 148,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0155#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "由此可见，向量的长度等于它的坐标的平方和的平方根.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题2。求两个非零向量 $\\vec a=(x_1,y_1,z_1)$ 和 $\\vec b=(x_2,y_2,z_2)$ 的夹角 $\\varphi$（图4）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 148,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0155#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "问题2. 求两个非零向量 $\\vec a=(x_1,y_1,z_1)$ 和 $\\vec b=(x_2,y_2,z_2)$的夹角 $\\varphi$（图4）.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "解。从两个向量的数性积的定义得到，\n$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b}{|\\vec a|\\cdot|\\vec b|}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 148,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0155#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "解. 从两个向量的数性积的定义得到，$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b}{|\\vec a|\\cdot|\\vec b|}$.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "但是 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2$（§42）；\n$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}$，\n$|\\vec b|=\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}$（问题1）。于是",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 148,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0155#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "但是 $\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2$（§42）；$|\\vec a|=\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}$，$|\\vec b|=\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}$（问题1）. 于是",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2}{\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 148,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0155#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "$\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{x_1x_2+y_1y_2+z_1z_2}{\\sqrt{x_1^2+y_1^2+z_1^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{x_2^2+y_2^2+z_2^2}}$.",
      "changes": ["layout"],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    }
  ],
